<title>UK: Banco de Credito de Sao Paulo to issue dollar bond.</title>
<headline>Banco de Credito de Sao Paulo to issue dollar bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Banco de Credito de Sao Paulo is to launch a $40 million eight-year step-up bond, mandated joint lead manager WestMerchant bank said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>Marcep Overseas Trust Ltd is the other lead manager.</p>
<p>Launch is expected in mid-June with pricing expected to be in the region of 435-465 basis points over the three-year U.S. Treasuries.</p>
<p>There will be put and calls in years three and five. -- London Newsroom  +44 171 542 7970</p>
</text>
